### Local secrets ###
# JWT_SECRET, MAIL_PASSWORD and EVENT_IMAGE_PATH have no defaults in application.yml, so every
# developer needs somewhere local to put them. These are those places, and neither is ever
# committed. The repository's git history already contains one leaked signing key; it does not
# need a second.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
application-local.yml
src/main/resources/application-local.yml
src/main/resources/application-local.properties
